  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you name two favorites categories the same name they become the same entry in the database. It copies all of the favorites between the two and any time you try to change their name again it changes both of their names. I think it's something to do with the database not looking at players favorite category names as separate entities. It is perma broken for me right now until an Admin touches my database entry up or it gets patched.",
